<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian and Eritrean forces are massing troops along their shared border, while clashes between Ethiopian militia and Somali Federalist Party supporters in Moyale have displaced thousands and prompted the EU to provide about Sh80 million in emergency aid. A drone strike near Badme wounded four civilians, and a Bioengineer.org study reports high rates of suicidal behavior among conflict-affected Ethiopian high schoolers. The conflict has already caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNeEJBNVB0dkdmX1h1VU1fRTJkVGdQN3oyWWZlOTBqaFVPOHBIcWk2YlJ1M2poeFpLcWxlNV9rOHBQYTRwdzRaN2ZKbkNveGgyMkFBRmY1b2t4REJSampnVjdaZnlmYVA3Vm1oU0o5T093T0t0QjNQZU8xeHRzWGZRaERvVXJpUFNqZDhQcjZfSVFHSktmVGZ5anIzZWpxMXlfU0VqR2VybTFlSzl1R0M1R01IY1BEanRJSFJQQU5pLWFXMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE8zNTVaTFVVNVY0SUFBX1BrS05MM0kzUzluajhFZTcwdC02ekRERU5VbkZDajRNMUw3VmRSQVAyR1RoM1dNamNEVTJLR2Q5SXY2Q29aUEpDVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5VUzBzZDdGOTFaZDRVZUdGRVpobjd6UUxsTnZOWFRuZVVCSEtvcUIxdnR6SU9xb3JQYlVFR3dmbDVuYVoyVld3VG1aYmpfZU5SSUN0dzgzQV8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNRE93eXhHTHZGUUZJclFDY3lINUNkSkRYbnFQY2htX2ZidHhRTWJLOUZJNkx1bWktaElTSElZV05LWXZjUWxVd29maElLLTV5NU9ndUR6eVgwdEVoc21BOE5wLTRGbWU0bUtJTkZQNjNYVVNwcy0wVDRPNkhXckRCTTB6c2ZjQklNSURtR1pxX0VUaWlOU0Zsc01ZbXlZT0plYmUzVm1uNk5KQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bioengineer.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tr